### Root endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create a property
POST http://localhost:3000/api/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "3BR Flat in Sangotedo",
  "location_name": "Sangotedo",
  "lat": 6.4698,
  "lng": 3.6285,
  "price": 5000000,
  "bedrooms": 3,
  "bathrooms": 2
}

### Create another property (same location, different name)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "2BR Apartment near Ajah",
  "location_name": "Sangotedo, Ajah",
  "lat": 6.472,
  "lng": 3.6301,
  "price": 3500000,
  "bedrooms": 2,
  "bathrooms": 1
}

### Search properties by location (case-insensitive)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/properties/search?location=sangotedo

### Search with different case
GET http://localhost:3000/api/properties/search?location=SANGOTEDO

### Search with location variation (space separated)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/properties/search?location=sangotedo%20lagos

### Search with location variation (comma separated)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/properties/search?location=sangotedo,ajah

### Search with location variation (space separated)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/properties/search?location=sangotedo%20ajah

### Search with location variation (comma separated)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/properties/search?location=sangotedo,lagos

### Search with location variation (space separated)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/properties/search?location=sangotedo%20lagos


### Get bucket statistics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/geo-buckets/stats
